                                                                                
 Usage: python -m run_intelligence view-health-log [OPTIONS]                    
                                                                                
 View details of a specific health log entry.                                   
                                                                                
 Shows all recorded fields for the specified health log entry.                  
 Example:     run-intelligence view-health-log --id 1                           
 Exit codes:     0: Success     1: Database error     2: Entry not found        
 (invalid ID)                                                                   
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ *  --id          INTEGER  Health log entry ID to view [required]             │
│    --help                 Show this message and exit.                        │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

